    "Total size of these patches: about 194 KB",
    "In addition to the above required patches, there exist a number of optional patches created by the LFS community. These optional patches solve minor problems or enable functionality that is not enabled by default. Feel free to peruse the patches database located at <a class=\"ulink\" href=\"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/patches/downloads/\">https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/patches/downloads/</a> and acquire any additional patches to suit your system needs."
